"""Uniform one-step absorbing shell of 518 constant typed d2 states.

This is an exact witness list with integer coefficients. Rows were discovered
by reversing the explicit 80-state productive corridor through all uniformly
legal FIRST/early-RUN/near-LAST prefix choices i=a*n+b, a in {0,1},
b in the specified small index range, retaining only candidates with s=±1
and exact positive-power strict-margin certificates on 0<h<1/5.

The proof is NOT these discovery rules. A canonical verifier checks EVERY
actual child identity coefficientwise, uniform prefix legality, both Perron
margins, the nonzero offset sum and the ranked target reference, while
independent Python re-derives the same from integer arithmetic. No claim
of all-n seed reachability or full d2 carrier productivity is made.
"""


